       }
      ],
      "text": "Peds dosing:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " starting dose by age: 0–3 mo 10–15 mcg/kg/day; 3–6 mo 8–10; 6–12 mo 6–8; 1–5 y 5–6; 6–12 y 4–5; > 12 y w growth/puberty incomplete 2–3; growth and puberty complete 1.6 mcg/kg/day; can't swallow tablets: crush, suspend in 5–10 mL H2O and give STAT by spoon or dropper."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
