    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Warfarin response increases (anticoag dose may need lowering; monitor coag tests). Digoxin effect may fall. In diabetes, glycemic control may worsen and insulin/antidiabetic needs rise; monitor glucose."
     }
